==History ==
2016  
*The Balloon [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], added the Death Damage statistic to the Balloon's card info screen.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Balloon's sight range to 7.7 tiles (from 8 tiles).
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Balloon's hitpoints by 5%.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May%202016%20Update%20(3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the size of the Balloon's hitpoint bar to prevent it from being recognized as a low-health troop when encountered. The update also fixed the “range bug”, which decreased the Balloon's range to 0.1 tiles (from 0.4 tiles), but its effective range was unchanged.
*On 15/12/2016, the [[Version History#December 2016 Update (15/12/2016)|December 2016 Update]], increased the Balloon's death damage by 105% and its death damage explosion radius to 3 tiles (from 2 tiles).
2017
*On 19/4/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/4/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the Balloon's death damage time to 3 seconds (from 1 second).
2018
*On 6/8/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2018)|Balance Update]], allowed the Balloon to be knocked back.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
2019
*On 28/1/2019, the [[Version History#January%202019%20Update%20(28/1/2019)|January 2019 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Balloon from Bone Pit to Builder’s Workshop.
*On 15/4/2019, the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]], added an extra [[Star Points|Star Level]].
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Balloon's card info screen.
2021
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Balloon's death damage by 27%.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022 
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/2/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Balloon's damage by 33%, but also decreased its attack time interval to 2 seconds (from 3 seconds).
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Balloon from Builder's Workshop to Royal Arena.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14). It also added the Siege Weapon [[Card Mastery]] task for the Balloon.
2025
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Balloon's hitpoints by 0.05%.
2026

* On 2/2/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Balloon's damage by 0.02%.

